  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0E82">Definition <span data-tag="0E82">109.16.4</span>.</a> We denote $\mathcal{M}$ and we name it the <em>moduli stack of smooth proper curves</em> the algebraic stack $\mathcal{C}\! \mathit{urves}^{smooth, h0}$ parametrizing families of curves introduced in Lemma <a href="/tag/0E81" data-tag="0E81">109.16.3</a>. For $g \geq 0$ we denote $\mathcal{M}_ g$ and we name it the <em>moduli stack of smooth proper curves of genus $g$</em> the algebraic stack introduced in Lemma <a href="/tag/0E83" data-tag="0E83">109.16.5</a>. </p>
